build t/CMakeFiles/listed.dir/listed.cpp.o: CXX_COMPILER__listed_unscanned_Debug listed.cpp
build t/listed: CXX_EXECUTABLE_LINKER__listed_Debug t/CMakeFiles/listed.dir/listed.cpp.o
build t/CMakeFiles/other.dir/other.cpp.o: CXX_COMPILER__other_unscanned_Debug other.cpp
build t/other: CXX_EXECUTABLE_LINKER__other_Debug t/CMakeFiles/other.dir/other.cpp.o
build compile-first.stamp: CUSTOM_COMMAND || t/listed
build compile_first: phony compile-first.stamp
build all: phony t/listed t/other compile_first
default all
